ercised by", "options": {"A": "suppliers", "B": "banks", "C": "nobody", "D": "officers with finance concurrence"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qwjr8n8g76q"}, {"q": "The ultimate aim of economy measures is", "options": {"A": "savings for parties", "B": "harassment", "C": "optimum use of public money", "D": "delays"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1775i9yvqj9"}]